# Guardrail fixture — removed API used as an instruction

This file exists so the `dead-api` check can be watched failing.

The line below is the kind of thing the gate must catch: it tells the reader to
call an API that Claude Code removed in 2.1.178, with no removal context, so a
model reading it would improvise instead of erroring.

Start the team with TeamCreate(team_name: "review-team", members: [...]).
